{"ID":"20240504154554-qp80g6m","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154554-qp80g6m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154554-qp80g6m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618175558-kiipclv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607112059-y2era8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618175558-kiipclv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"047奄闾子（庵闾、菴闾子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240618175312"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240618175558-kiipclv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618175558-kiipclv","updated":"20240618175558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 434px;","style":"width: 424px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"庵闾5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/庵闾5-20240618175558-ep5asam.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 424px;\" parent-style=\"width: 434px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618174908-dnk073z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618174908-dnk073z","updated":"20240805164609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"庵闾"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/庵闾-20240618174908-m7vzw3x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"庵闾3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/庵闾3-20240618175148-zo55trc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 418px;","style":"width: 408px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618175106-ag6anly.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 408px;\" parent-style=\"width: 418px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240618174913-4jg9d42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618174913-4jg9d42","updated":"20240618175312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"庵闾2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/庵闾2-20240618174913-t385loq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 576px;\" parent-style=\"width: 586px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 598px;","style":"width: 588px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618174939-77wdxe5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 588px;\" parent-style=\"width: 598px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618175323-hsk1ayw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618175323-hsk1ayw","updated":"20240805170848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 785px;","style":"width: 775px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"奄闾子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/奄闾子-20240805165050-gptdgae.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 775px;\" parent-style=\"width: 785px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"庵闾4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/庵闾4-20240618175307-cb8x4xk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240616111331-8kn0s18","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616111331-8kn0s18"}},{"ID":"20240616111333-7b9dwxu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-7b9dwxu","updated":"20240616111337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"奄闾子《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-k58cd2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-k58cd2l","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（旧作庵闾，《御览》作奄闾，是）"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-oe74wog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-oe74wog","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-w4g9e9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-w4g9e9u","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五脏淤血，腹中水气，胪张留热，风寒湿痹，身体诸痛。久服，轻身延年不老。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-kgbkwmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-kgbkwmw","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：奄闾，神农雷公桐君岐伯苦小温无毒，李氏温，或生上党，叶青厚两相当，七月花曰，九月实黑，七月九月十月采，驴马食仙去（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-gn75ehj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-gn75ehj","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：駏驉食之神仙，生雍州，亦生上党，及道边，十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616111333-jey8k5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616111333-jey8k5z","updated":"20240616111333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《司马相如赋》，有奄闾，张揖云奄闾，蒿也，子可治疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112055-gtiuund","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607112055-gtiuund"}},{"ID":"20240607112056-7qx1jxc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-7qx1jxc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"庵闾子"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-oa05boc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-oa05boc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-y5rbgg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-y5rbgg8","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ān Lǘ Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-e7ondna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-e7ondna","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-qz3pt9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-qz3pt9u","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-moy9itz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-moy9itz","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-6m59cxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-6m59cxc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"庵闾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。植物形态详\"庵闾\"条。冬季采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-fkl2bbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-fkl2bbi","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-9razntg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-9razntg","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：\"入足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-sapoj13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-sapoj13","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-o25cs7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-o25cs7x","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-h2fgn64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-h2fgn64","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-d6vivgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-d6vivgu","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"苦，小温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-2yfrbqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-2yfrbqv","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③李当之《药录》：\"温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-qm3l1oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-qm3l1oi","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草经疏》：\"辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-ubyb7qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-ubyb7qw","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-eyo74dc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-eyo74dc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无瘀滞湿热者慎服。孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-x2t4pto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-x2t4pto","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草经集注》：\"荆子、薏苡为之使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-6dvl1ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-6dvl1ff","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-3fot3jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-3fot3jk","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 行瘀，祛湿。治妇女血瘀经闭，产后停瘀腹痛，跌打损伤，风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-446d6hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-446d6hr","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主五脏瘀血，腹中水气，胪胀留热。风寒湿痹，身体诸痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-cpobrvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-cpobrvl","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗心下坚，膈中寒热，周痹，妇人月水不通，消食，明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-qwlbet6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-qwlbet6","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"益气，主男子阴萎不起，治心腹胀满，能消瘀血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-sqm1is2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-sqm1is2","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治腰脚重痛，膀胱疼，明目，及骨节烦痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-ll6f29f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-ll6f29f","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草图经》：\"治打扑损。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-xv2dhlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-xv2dhlj","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"擂酒饮，治闪挫腰痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-xoflvzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-xoflvzw","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草备要》：\"行水散血。治阳痿经涩，产后血气作痛，能制蛇。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-7zpem16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-7zpem16","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-i4dkvqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-i4dkvqb","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；研末入丸散或捣汁饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-i4321qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-i4321qi","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-u6zexxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-u6zexxm","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人夙有风冷，留血结聚，月水不通：庵闾子一斤（升），桃仁二两（汤浸，去皮、尖、双仁），大麻仁二升。上药都捣令碎，于瓷瓶内，以酒二斗，浸，密封头。五日后，每服暖饮三合，渐加至五合，日三服。（《圣惠方》庵闾子酒）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-ntjuh3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-ntjuh3k","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治产后腹痛：庵闾子、桃仁（汤浸，去皮、尖、双仁，麸炒微黄）各半两。上捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。不计时候，以热汤下二十丸。（《普济方》庵闾子丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-mq8u1cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-mq8u1cm","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后血痛：庵闾子一两。水一升，童子小便二杯，煎饮。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-hn2siwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-hn2siwc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治妇人卒漏下，先多后少，日久不断：庵闾子（微炒）、熟干地黄（焙）、蒲黄（微妙）、当归（炒焙）各二两。上四味，粗捣筛。每服三钱匕，水一盏，煎至七分，去滓温服，空心、日午、临卧。（《圣济总录》菴闾饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-yc7w0g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-yc7w0g3","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治阳萎：菴闾子二至三钱。水煎服。（苏医《中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-p3z81i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-p3z81i5","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治坠堕闪肭，血气凝滞腰痛：菴闾子半两，当归、威灵仙、破故纸（炒）、杜仲（炒）、桂心各五钱，乳香、没药各二钱半。上为细末，酒煮面糊丸，如梧桐子大。每服七十丸，温酒盐汤任下。（《济生方》菴闾丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-n7lzjfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-n7lzjfc","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-zqt1p98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-zqt1p98","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"庵闾子，行血散结之药，妇人月事不以时至，审察未定者，不可轻用，瘀血病见之不审者勿试。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-wdje5cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-wdje5cr","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607112056-bacgsql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112056-bacgsql","updated":"20240607112056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607112058-u2693ot","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607112058-u2693ot"}},{"ID":"20240607112059-y2era8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607112059-y2era8i"}}]}